<title>FRANCE: BIC first half net attrib rises.</title>
<headline>BIC first half net attrib rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     339  vs	     310</p>
<p>    Net adjusted per share (francs)	12.26  vs	   11.20</p>
<p>    Operating					592  vs	     580</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   619  vs	     654</p>
<p>    Financial gain				  27  vs		74</p>
<p>    Turnover before tax			3,192  vs	   3,091</p>
<p>NOTE - The company issued the results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
